{"w":2400,"h":3406,"lines":[{"y":0.043604651201669897,"h":0.01453488361674482,"w":0.12577320098876954,"c":1,"x":0.068041234446571175,"t":"Audioscripts"},{"t":"storerooms over to other purposes. like using them for meetings.","x":0.068041236219633511,"w":0.54639175415039065,"h":0.013081395479068947,"y":0.091569767374117816,"c":1},{"h":0.017131627340983169,"c":1,"x":0.065929453042084946,"t":"We try hard to involve members of the public in the theatre. One way is by organising.","y":0.11370891401463423,"w":0.73207590738932293},{"w":0.72588567097981782,"t":"backstage tours, so people can be shown round the building and leam how a theatre.","x":0.065925867597585841,"y":0.13091449399407118,"c":1,"h":0.015904586173755897},{"y":0.1467997653248394,"h":0.014679976512037562,"x":0.065979385482407338,"t":"operates. These are proving very popular. What we're finding is that people want to have","w":0.75257731119791671,"c":1},{"x":0.063917533093773501,"y":0.16265413969767817,"h":0.016147974163241319,"w":0.7587628682454427,"c":1,"t":"lunch or a cup of coffee while they're here, so we're looking into the possibility of opening"},{"c":1,"h":0.017441861012089777,"t":"a café in due course. We have a bookshop, which speciallses in books about drama, and.","x":0.065979370098280019,"y":0.18023255786288839,"w":0.76494847615559891},{"w":0.78155410766601563,"h":0.017682333658949667,"c":1,"x":0.065925577077355704,"t":"that attracts plenty of customers. Then there are two large rooms that will be decorated next","y":0.19432644016164835},{"c":1,"x":0.065979369544831926,"h":0.01453488361674482,"t":"month, and theyll be available for hire, for conferences and private functions, such as parties.","y":0.21220930237559177,"w":0.79587631225585942},{"x":0.065979373209261352,"c":1,"w":0.57938145955403642,"t":"We're also considering hiring out costumes to amateur drama clubs.","h":0.014679976512037674,"y":0.22812683489020669},{"w":0.77938145955403648,"t":"Now I want to tell you about our workshops. We recently started a programme of workshops","h":0.014679976512037674,"c":1,"y":0.25132119761038096,"x":0.06597937319884295},{"h":0.017520462143652105,"y":0.26652136036160468,"w":0.7609621175130209,"t":"that anyone can join. Eventually we intend to run courses in acting, but we're waiting until","x":0.063841162571104629,"c":1},{"x":0.063917537208131037,"w":0.71958760579427095,"h":0.016147974163241319,"c":1,"y":0.28332354664084791,"t":"we've got the right people in place as trainers. That's proving more difficult than we'd"},{"y":0.30087209307321738,"w":0.78144327799479174,"x":0.063917536159661947,"t":"expected! There's a big demand to learn about the technical side of putting on a production,","h":0.014534883616744709,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.77319585164388016,"y":0.31679389332243701,"t":"and our lighting workshop has already started, with great success. We're going to start one","x":0.063917537962059512,"h":0.014679976512037562},{"t":"on sound next month. A number of people have enquired about workshops on make-up,","x":0.063917551513705276,"y":0.33139534880665589,"w":0.74845357259114587,"h":0.015988371754420694,"c":1},{"t":"and that's something we're considering for the future. A surprise success is the workshop on","x":0.063832838951221244,"y":0.34618147227934126,"c":1,"w":0.78368113199869793,"h":0.019290809832946509},{"w":0.76916737874348962,"x":0.063883931013155287,"y":0.36191865964198766,"t":"making puppets - we happen to have someone working here who does it as a hobby, and","h":0.017457603638268759,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.37933837636385959,"w":0.7362008666992188,"h":0.016059043333240597,"x":0.063861513668391767,"t":"she offered to run a workshop, It was so popular we're now running them every month!"},{"x":0.87003304776732837,"t":"Q13 & 14","y":0.11458587809349563,"w":0.088799883524576795,"h":0.013560801901960184,"c":1},{"x":0.86999432228741647,"h":0.013833506836726017,"c":1,"t":"Q13 & 14","w":0.088877334594726576,"y":0.18130999075223053},{"t":"Q15 & 16","h":0.014210072112517458,"x":0.86994218809116475,"y":0.31629612671857887,"w":0.088981602986653585,"c":1},{"x":0.8699938971770651,"w":0.084754473368326866,"c":1,"t":"Q15 & 16","h":0.013800366794230023,"y":0.34557074652954745},{"t":"Now, a word about the layout of the building. The auditorium, stage and dressing rooms for","y":0.42865531391508904,"h":0.014679976512037562,"c":1,"x":0.063917537990233197,"w":0.77319585164388016},{"h":0.017464436717545828,"w":0.76507039388020837,"y":0.44303581770387068,"t":"the actors are all below ground level. Here on the ground floor we have most of the rooms","c":1,"x":0.061793228734227816},{"h":0.016147974163241319,"c":1,"w":0.7958762613932292,"t":"that the public doesn't see. The majority are internal, so they have windows in the roof to light","x":0.061855689818849174,"y":0.45918966542226036},{"x":0.063917525142717743,"y":0.47819767417168069,"w":0.051546392440795896,"t":"them.","h":0.011627907341393184,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.065979383171428665,"t":"Standing here in the foyer, you're probably wondering why the box office isn't here, where the","w":0.79175257364908846,"y":0.50000000016617863,"h":0.015988371754420694},{"t":"public would expect to find it. Well, you might have noticed it on your way in - although it's","w":0.77113403320312501,"x":0.061855664527303511,"h":0.016147974163241319,"c":1,"y":0.51585437456092242},{"w":0.62268040974934891,"h":0.01453488361674482,"x":0.063917526973858399,"c":1,"y":0.53343023260743705,"t":"part of this building, it's next door, with a separate entrance from the road."},{"w":0.78969070434570299,"h":0.014679976512037562,"x":0.063917534345423993,"y":0.55666470956787917,"c":1,"t":"For the theatre manager's office, you go across the foyer and through the double doors, turn"},{"c":1,"x":0.06185565989413945,"y":0.57267441864520829,"t":"right, and it's the room at the end of the corridor, with the door on the left","w":0.61855672200520839,"h":0.01453488361674482},{"t":"The lighting box is where the computerised stage lighting is operated, and it's at the back of","c":1,"x":0.061855661993436492,"y":0.59593023272281997,"w":0.77938145955403648,"h":0.015988371754420583},{"t":"the building. When you're through the double doors, turn left, turn right at the water cooler.","h":0.017244186670165584,"y":0.61074514032963267,"c":1,"w":0.77124364217122388,"x":0.061808877319895338},{"c":1,"x":0.061855679542799843,"h":0.015988371754420583,"y":0.62790697690238439,"t":"and right again at the end. It's the second room along that corridor. The lighting box has a","w":0.7587628682454427},{"h":0.018568574297239127,"x":0.06176818066571433,"t":"window into the auditorium, which of course is below us.","c":1,"y":0.64365456925686548,"w":0.47851938883463552},{"t":"The artistic director's office is through the double doors, turn right, and its the first room you","x":0.061775635086671533,"y":0.66797463632797049,"w":0.78366312662760418,"h":0.017591492120336172,"c":1},{"t":"come to on the right-hand side. And finally, for the moment, the room where I'll take you next","y":0.68459302322526072,"w":0.78556696573893225,"x":0.061855690300636944,"h":0.015988371754420694,"c":1},{"w":0.48262741088867184,"c":1,"y":0.69930877393110724,"h":0.017212550218708711,"x":0.063816144554317777,"t":"- the relaxation room. So if you'd like to come with me ..."},{"c":1,"t":"Q17","y":0.51598837207904824,"h":0.01453488361674482,"w":0.039175256093343158,"x":0.86804123790459353},{"y":0.55668604640803732,"t":"Q18","w":0.041237112681070998,"h":0.013081395479068947,"x":0.86597938170676592,"c":1},{"t":"Q19","w":0.039175256093343158,"c":1,"x":0.8659793821652414,"h":0.013081395479068947,"y":0.59738372082877944},{"t":"Q20","c":1,"x":0.86597938170676592,"y":0.66860465105920019,"h":0.013081395479068947,"w":0.041237112681070998},{"x":0.057731960100401047,"y":0.76012918391287887,"t":"SECTION 3","w":0.16494845072428385,"h":0.016147974163241319,"c":1},{"y":0.7921511628815876,"x":0.057731959068322472,"h":0.010174418083724102,"w":0.053608245849609382,"t":"HELEN:","c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.72592005411783855,"t":"I've brought my notes on our Biology Field Trip to Rocky Bay, Colin, so we can work","x":0.11538759650822404,"y":0.78796992579607339,"h":0.019397943914461591},{"t":"on our report on the research we did together.","w":0.3917525736490885,"h":0.013081395479069058,"c":1,"x":0.12783505330858341,"y":0.80668604644136177},{"y":0.82412790720906748,"h":0.011627906221399864,"c":1,"x":0.055670103745347914,"w":0.051546389261881508,"t":"COLIN:"},{"t":"HELEN:","y":0.84110534889360256,"w":0.053897418975830079,"c":1,"x":0.057587372879737704,"h":0.0096497672904749532},{"h":0.011801580226358355,"c":1,"x":0.055629242778942115,"y":0.85601781447427017,"t":"COLIN:","w":0.049566256205240883},{"c":1,"t":"OK. Ive got mine too. Let's look at the aims of the trip first.","y":0.82266588374442173,"w":0.50309280395507805,"x":0.12371132987270514,"h":0.014679976512037562},{"h":0.014679976512037562,"t":"Right. What did you have?","w":0.22886596679687499,"c":1,"x":0.12371134639824059,"y":0.83852025815248676},{"x":0.12577320283410226,"w":0.68247421264648445,"y":0.85465116284021325,"t":"I just put something about getting experience of the different sorts of procedures","c":1,"h":0.01453488361674482},{"w":0.77536860148111975,"t":"used on a field trip. But we need something about what causes different organisms to Q21","y":0.8691076201016551,"x":0.1257216952423342,"c":1,"h":0.016440519779763019},{"t":"choose particular habitats.","y":0.88652919485063564,"w":0.22513267517089844,"h":0.01616947019513193,"c":1,"x":0.12765169865712531},{"c":1,"y":0.90489278369821358,"x":0.057539453922411186,"w":0.05399325688680013,"h":0.0099818744312225594,"t":"HELEN:"},{"c":1,"w":0.7278350321451823,"x":0.12371134982656087,"h":0.016147974163241319,"y":0.90252495610010197,"t":"Lagree. And something about finding out how to protect organisms in danger of dying"},{"x":0.12577319633987691,"h":0.013081395479069058,"t":"out?","y":0.91860465098866317,"w":0.041237112681070942,"c":1},{"w":0.039175256093343096,"x":0.057731959473374277,"c":1,"y":0.95203488361947708,"h":0.013081395479068947,"t":"110"},{"h":0.022615832576874939,"t":"leltsresources.org","w":0.29146792093912754,"y":0.9543054561580997,"x":0.3521918184962084,"c":1}]}